msgid ""
"An overview of what data Nexora processes, why, and what rights you have "
"over it."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:35
msgid "1. Controller"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:37
msgid ""
"The controller responsible for data processing on this site within the "
"meaning of the GDPR is:"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:45
msgid "2. Hosting and server log files"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:47
msgid "This site is hosted by"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:47
msgid "name of the hosting provider"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:47
msgid ", an EU-based hosting provider."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:50
msgid ""
"The hosting provider's web server automatically records access data for "
"every page request in log files, including the requesting IP address, date "
"and time, the requested page, the amount of data transferred, and the "
"browser's user agent. This data is processed to operate the site reliably "
"and securely (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR) and is not merged with other data sources."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:55
msgid "3. Cookies"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:56
msgid ""
"Nexora only uses technically necessary cookies. No analytics, advertising or "
"tracking cookies are set."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:58
msgid ""
"sessionid – keeps you signed in; expires after about two weeks of inactivity."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:59
msgid ""
"csrftoken – protects forms against cross-site request forgery; a standard "
"security cookie."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:60
msgid ""
"django_language – remembers your chosen interface language for the current "
"browser session."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:65
msgid "4. Registration and user account"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:67
msgid ""
"If you create an account, we store your username and a securely hashed "
"password to let you sign in and manage your own overlays (Art. 6(1)(b) "
"GDPR). An email address is only stored if you choose to add one in your "
"account settings."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:72
msgid "5. Spotify connection (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:74
msgid ""
"If you choose to connect a Spotify account to a Spotify overlay, Nexora "
"requests the limited \"currently playing\" permission and receives an access "
"and refresh token from Spotify, which we store encrypted. We use this to "
"display your currently playing track title, artist, album artwork and "
"playback progress. No other Spotify profile data is requested. This "
"processing is based on your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR) and can be withdrawn "
"at any time by disconnecting Spotify in the overlay settings."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:79
msgid "6. Twitch connection (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:81
msgid ""
"If you choose to connect a Twitch account to a Twitch Goal overlay, Nexora "
"requests permission to read your follower and/or subscriber counts and "
"receives an access and refresh token, which we store encrypted, along with "
"your Twitch user ID, login name, display name, profile image and cached "
"follower/subscriber counts. This processing is based on your consent (Art. "
"6(1)(a) GDPR). Disconnecting Twitch, or deleting your account, revokes the "
"token directly with Twitch."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:86
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Spotify Overlay"
msgid "7. Uploaded images and fonts"
msgstr "Spotify Overlay"

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:88
msgid ""
"Images and fonts you upload for your overlays are stored as provided. "
"Uploaded image files are not automatically stripped of embedded metadata "
"(such as EXIF data, which can include the device used or a GPS location) — "
"please remove any sensitive metadata yourself before uploading an image if "
"this matters to you."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:93
msgid "8. No analytics or tracking"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:94
msgid ""
"Nexora does not use any analytics, advertising or third-party tracking tools."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:98
msgid "9. Email communication"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:99
msgid ""
"Nexora does not currently send any emails. Should this change in the future, "
"this policy will be updated accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:103
msgid "10. Storage duration and deletion"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:105
msgid ""
"Your data is stored for as long as your account exists. From your account "
"settings you can permanently delete your account at any time; this removes "
"your overlays, templates and uploaded files, revokes the Twitch connection, "
"and deletes your account. Spotify access cannot be revoked through Spotify's "
"API from within Nexora — please also remove Nexora from the connected-apps "
"settings of your Spotify account."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:110
msgid "11. Your rights"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:111
msgid "Subject to the legal requirements, you have the right to:"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:113
msgid ""
"request information about the personal data we process about you (Art. 15 "
"GDPR);"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:114
msgid "request the correction of inaccurate data (Art. 16 GDPR);"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:115
msgid "request the erasure of your data (Art. 17 GDPR);"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:116
msgid "request the restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR);"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:117
msgid ""
"receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format (Art. 20 GDPR);"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:118
msgid "object to processing based on legitimate interest (Art. 21 GDPR);"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:119
msgid ""
"withdraw any consent you have given at any time, with effect for the future "
"(Art. 7(3) GDPR); and"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:120
msgid ""
"lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority (Art. 77 "
"GDPR)."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:125
msgid "12. Encryption"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:127
msgid ""
"If this site is served over HTTPS, all data transmitted between your browser "
"and our servers is encrypted in transit."
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:132
msgid "13. Changes to this policy"
msgstr ""

#: .\app\templates\app\privacy.html:134
msgid ""
"We may update this privacy policy from time to time to reflect changes to "
"the service or to legal requirements. Please check back occasionally to stay "
"informed."
